            "detailed_description": "<strong>History</strong><br><br>In a Technology Center, a Super Computer is invaded by hackers known as &quot;The Public&quot;. They continue to search for Power runes and have control over all local machines, except for one robot (Metronix-47) that has the updated algorithm, preventing hacking by &quot;The Public&quot;, its mission is to recover the runes of Power and disable &quot;A Hacker Invasion&quot;.<br><br><strong>Features :</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Characters with different mechanics.<br></li><li> Collectible.<br></li><li> Time-Trials.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>History</strong><br><br>In a Technology Center, a Super Computer is invaded by hackers known as &quot;The Public&quot;. They continue to search for Power runes and have control over all local machines, except for one robot (Metronix-47) that has the updated algorithm, preventing hacking by &quot;The Public&quot;, its mission is to recover the runes of Power and disable &quot;A Hacker Invasion&quot;.<br><br><strong>Features :</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Characters with different mechanics.<br></li><li> Collectible.<br></li><li> Time-Trials.</li></ul>",
